#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:2
msgid "Run a Goal with Progress Tracking"
msgstr "运行带进度跟踪的 Goal"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:4
msgid ""
"A Goal is for an outcome that may need several rounds of inspection, "
"editing, and verification. It is more persistent than a single message "
"and more outcome-focused than a short Plan."
msgstr "Goal 用于需要多轮检查、编辑和验证才能达成的结果。它比单条消息更持久，也比短 Plan 更关注最终结果。"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:9
msgid "Write a good Goal"
msgstr "编写好的 Goal"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:11
msgid "Describe the result in a way that another person could check. Include:"
msgstr "以他人可以检查的方式描述结果。请包含："

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:13
msgid "the project area and the behavior to change;"
msgstr "项目区域和要修改的行为；"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:14
msgid "important constraints, such as Godot version or files to preserve;"
msgstr "重要约束，例如 Godot 版本或必须保留的文件；"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:15
msgid ""
"what “done” means, such as a test, scene run, or diagnostic with no "
"errors."
msgstr "“完成”的含义，例如测试通过、场景运行成功或诊断无错误。"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:17
msgid "For example::"
msgstr "例如："

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:24
msgid "Goal status"
msgstr "Goal 状态"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:26
msgid ""
"The Goal panel shows status, cycles, tokens, active time, readiness, "
"evaluation, and the current workflow. Common stages include:"
msgstr "Goal 面板显示状态、周期、token、活动时间、就绪状态、评估结果和当前工作流。常见阶段包括："

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:29
msgid "**Checking readiness** — Studio is making sure the goal can start;"
msgstr "**Checking readiness** — Studio 正在确认 Goal 可以开始；"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:30
msgid "**Running** — the agent is executing work;"
msgstr "**Running** — agent 正在执行工作；"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:31
msgid "**Evaluating** — the completion evaluator is checking the result;"
msgstr "**Evaluating** — 完成评估器正在检查结果；"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Awaiting approval** or **Awaiting tool budget** — you must decide how "
"to continue;"
msgstr "**Awaiting approval** 或 **Awaiting tool budget** — 你必须决定如何继续；"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:34
msgid "**Paused** — execution is stopped but the Goal is still available;"
msgstr "**Paused** — 执行已停止，但 Goal 仍然可用；"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Achieved**, **Failed**, or **Cancelled** — the Goal reached a terminal "
"state."
msgstr "**Achieved**、**Failed** 或 **Cancelled** — Goal 到达终止状态。"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:39
msgid "Todo steps and changed files"
msgstr "Todo 步骤和变更文件"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:41
msgid ""
"Long workflows can show a Todo list with current and completed steps. The"
" panel can also summarize which files changed. Treat both as navigation "
"aids: open the actual diff and verification output before deciding the "
"Goal is safe to keep."
msgstr "较长的工作流可以显示包含当前步骤和已完成步骤的 Todo 列表。面板还可以总结哪些文件发生了变化。请将二者都视为导航辅助：决定是否安全保留 Goal 结果前，请打开实际 diff 和验证输出。"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:47
msgid "Pause, resume, and cancel"
msgstr "暂停、恢复和取消"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:49
msgid ""
"Use **Pause** when you want to inspect the current state before the next "
"cycle. Use **Resume** after reviewing the diff and pending decisions. "
"**Cancel** stops the Goal after the current safe operation finishes; "
"existing workspace changes are kept."
msgstr "希望在下一周期前检查当前状态时，使用 **Pause**。审查 diff 和待处理决策后，使用 **Resume**。**Cancel** 会在当前安全操作完成后停止 Goal；现有工作区变更会保留。"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:54
msgid ""
"If the Goal needs more time, **Add budget** can add cycles, tokens, or "
"active minutes. A larger budget gives the run more room; it does not fix "
"an unclear request or a wrong workspace."
msgstr "如果 Goal 需要更多时间，**Add budget** 可以增加周期、token 或活动分钟数。更大的预算会为运行提供更多空间，但不能修复不清晰的请求或错误的工作区。"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:59
msgid "Rollback"
msgstr "回滚"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:61
msgid ""
"When tracked changes can be restored safely, **Roll back** restores the "
"tracked files to their state before the Goal. Rollback may be unavailable"
" for some changes, such as files changed outside the tracked set or "
"changes that cannot be restored confidently. Always inspect Git status "
"after a rollback."
msgstr "当跟踪的变更可以安全恢复时，**Roll back** 会将跟踪文件恢复到 Goal 开始前的状态。对于某些变更，回滚可能不可用，例如修改了跟踪集合之外的文件，或无法有把握地恢复的变更。回滚后请始终检查 Git status。"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:67
msgid "When to use Agent instead"
msgstr "何时改用 Agent"

#: ../../source/agent/goals.rst:69
msgid ""
"Use **Agent** for one bounded edit or check. Use **Goal** when the task "
"can naturally be divided into cycles and you want a visible completion "
"judgment. For a risky multi-file refactor, start with **Plan** and "
"approve the plan before converting the work into execution."
msgstr "单次范围明确的编辑或检查使用 **Agent**。任务可以自然拆分为多个周期，并且你希望看到明确完成判断时，使用 **Goal**。对于高风险的多文件重构，请先使用 **Plan**，批准计划后再转入执行。"
